# Proof packs in detail (docs/guide/how-proof-packs.md).
title: CI turns mapped tests and floor runs into a hashed pack that ship checks and lands before it merges
direction: down
ready: Ready snapshot: criteria and their hash
map: Evidence map: .aayudha/evidence/N.toml
verify: verify in the merge gate runs the tests and floors
pack: pack.json: criteria, artifacts, checks
art: aayudha-pack run artifact, media included
comment: PR comment: verdicts, floors, pack hash
ship: ship checks the run and the hashes
ledger: ledger: pack.json and data, no media
ready -> verify: criteria
map -> verify: tests per criterion
verify -> pack
pack -> art: retention_days
art -> comment: aayudha/pack
art -> ship: gate run on the head only
ship -> ledger: human identity
